{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://amaanimalrescue.org/adoption-application/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Mixed Breed","description_text":"Gus is a loving and resilient dog with a heart of gold, patiently waiting for a family to call his own. Found wandering the streets alone, Gus was thin, scared, and uncertain about the world around him. But with a little time, care, and love from his incredible foster family, Gus has blossomed into the affectionate, sweet-natured dog we know today.\n\nAlthough Gus may have had a rough start, he’s proven just how quickly he can warm up to the people he trusts. His foster family has discovered a dog full of love, ready to shower his new home with cuddles and companionship. Gus might need a little patience when it comes to training, but his eagerness to learn and please makes him a fast learner. He’s just waiting for the right person to guide him with gentle hands and a steady heart. He would thrive in a single person home.\n\nGus will thrive in a loving environment where he can feel safe and secure and a single person home, and in return, he’ll offer you endless affection, loyalty, and joy. If you’re ready to give Gus the forever home he deserves, he promises to be a loving companion through it all. Apply today to meet this sweet little guy.","detail_url":"https://amaanimalrescue.org/pet/gus/","id":"c53723f91f7fb0ccee8d9b7044994606","image_urls":["https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/dcb469a1-1855-427a-8bc2-40ad2ac0f96e-scaled-711x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/e04bde9c-a898-48c8-b207-38c14f17ec1a-scaled-768x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/6ab1e6a0-c6ee-4814-a0be-2e871380806f-768x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/6b3c9539-ca96-4a9d-80ce-ae6abf6bf2a5-768x1024.jpg","https://amaanimalrescue.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/7da3e4be-6fe3-4fd3